# PropertyTrail Privacy Notice

Effective 2026-11-23

## 1. What this notice covers

PropertyTrail is a property condition, inspection, inventory, maintenance and evidence management service operated by Zekini. This notice explains what personal information the service handles, why, and the choices available to you. It should be read with our Terms of Service.

## 2. Information we process

We process the information needed to provide the service: your account details; property and lease records you create; inspection notes, conditions and photographs you upload; signatures and signing records; and usage and audit records. Data minimisation and purpose limitation apply: we do not ask for more information than the service needs, we use it only for the purposes below, and we do not sell personal information.

## 3. Why we process it

We use this information to create and maintain property records, produce signed inspection reports, give access to the people you choose, keep an audit history, and operate and support the service. Consent is asked for where it is required. Access to a record is scoped to the organisation and the people assigned to it, and can be withdrawn.

## 4. How information is held

Tenant isolation keeps records separated by organisation so that one customer cannot see another's data. Uploaded files are kept in private storage, not served from a public folder. Links to a signed report are signed, time-limited and revocable. Access, signing and report events are recorded in an audit history. Transport is encrypted.

We never expose private owner notes, tenant contact details, other customers' records, unrelated property history or internal maintenance discussions through a public report link.

## 5. Sharing

A signed report is shared only with the parties you choose, using a private link you can revoke. We do not pass your records to third parties for advertising. Service providers used to operate the platform may process information only on our instructions.

## 6. Retention and your choices

Retention periods are configurable for each organisation. You can correct your account details, ask for a record to be amended where the service allows it, revoke a report link, and ask us about the personal information we hold. Some records, including audit entries and signed reports, are kept as a durable history and are not rewritten when a later record is amended.

## 7. Contact

Questions about privacy or about this notice can be sent to Zekini through the contact details published on our website.
